              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Opinion of inhabitants of Ede about various aspects of  living in Ede, the municipal policy and municipal facilities Crime, insecurity, and inconveniences in neighbourhood\twhere respondent is living  / quality of life / community  centres / participation in arts and culture / information  and involvement concerning town and country planning  by the municipality / opinion about the 'Information  Guide Municipality Ede 1997/1998' / environmental issues  / suggestion for questions in next survey Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ housing situation/ household characteristics/ occupation/employment/ income/capital assets/ education/ politics/ religion</p>"
                }
